  "label": "Colonialism and Economic Inequality",
  "description": "The role of colonialism in creating and perpetuating global economic disparities, including the extraction of resources from colonized territories, the imposition of unfair trade relationships, and the establishment of economic systems that favored colonial powers. The meme critiques the idea of forgetting colonialism by implying that such economic inequalities are a direct result of colonial exploitation.",
